# Shift-Left Security

Never store secrets, passwords, API keys, or connection strings in source or Git.

Use Azure Key Vault, pipeline secret variables, or environment configuration.

`guard: forbid-path: "**/*.pem"`
`guard: forbid-content: "/(api[_-]?key|password|secret)\\s*[:=]\\s*['\"][^'\"]{8,}/i"`
